# nexora-action-code: get_route_table
Value Filldown TOTAL_DESTINATIONS (\d+)
Value Filldown TOTAL_ROUTES (\d+)
Value Filldown DESTINATION (\S+)
Value Filldown PROTOCOL (\S+)
Value Filldown PREFERENCE (\d+)
Value Filldown COST (\d+)
Value NEXTHOP (\S+)
Value Required INTERFACE (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*Destinations\s*:\s*${TOTAL_DESTINATIONS}\s+Routes\s*:\s*${TOTAL_ROUTES}\s*$$
  ^\s*Destinations\s*:\s*${TOTAL_DESTINATIONS}\s+Routes\s*:\s*$$
  ^\s*${TOTAL_ROUTES}\s*$$
  ^\s*Destination/Mask\s+Proto\s+Pre\s+Cost\s+NextHop\s+Interface\s*$$
  ^\s*${DESTINATION}\s+${PROTOCOL}\s+${PREFERENCE}\s+${COST}\s+${NEXTHOP}\s+${INTERFACE}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s+${NEXTHOP}\s+${INTERFACE}\s*$$ -> Record
